<https://w3id.org/dpv#AutomatedDecisionMaking> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Automated Decision Making"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#AutomatedDecisionMaking> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Automated decision making can be defined as “the ability to make decisions by technological means without human involvement.” (“Guidelines on Automated individual decision-making and Profiling for the purposes of Regulation 2016/679 (wp251rev.01)”, 2018, p. 8)"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
