<https://w3id.org/dpv#AutomatedScoringOfIndividuals> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Scoring can lead to the action being considered Decision Making if the scoring is itself a decision - see 2023-MAR-16 opinion of Advocate General on Case C 634/21. Therefore, the assessment of whether scoring was automated or not is important given the legal obligations surrounding automated decision making e.g. in GDPR"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
