<https://w3id.org/dpv#Context> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Context"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#Context> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Context is a catch-all concept for information of relevance not possible to represent through other core concepts. DPV offers specific contextual concepts such as Necessity, Frequency, and Duration. More can be created by extending Context within use-cases."@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
