<https://w3id.org/dpv#DataImporter> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The term 'Data Importer' is used by the EU-EDPB as the entity that receives transferred data across borders. While the EDPB refers to the jurisdictional border of EU, the term within DPV can be used to denote any 'import' or reception of transfer or transmission of data and is thus a broader concept than the EDPB's definition."@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
