<https://w3id.org/dpv#ExpressedConsent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Consent that is expressed through an action intended to convey a consenting decision"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#ExpressedConsent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#consent-types-classes> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#ExpressedConsent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Expressed Consent"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#ExpressedConsent> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Expressed consent requires the individual take a specific and unambiguous action that directly indicates their consent. This action may be a part of other processes such as setting preferences, or agreeing to a contract, or other matters not relating to consent. An example of expressed consent is interacting with a checkbox within a dashboard or clicking a button on a web form"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
