<https://w3id.org/dpv#JointDataControllers> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "While Joint Data Controllers operate together, they are made up of individually distinct legal entities. To indicate the membership of this group, hasDataController should be used to denote each Data Controller. The concept of Joint Data Controllers also allows specifying a single group as the 'Controller' and to specify role and responsibilities within that group for each entity using DPV's concepts (e.g. isImplementedByEntity)"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
