<https://w3id.org/dpv#NonPersonalDataProcess> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use of personal data within NonPersonalDataProcess should be considered a violation of the explicit constraint that no personal data is involved."@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
