<https://w3id.org/dpv#RenewedConsentGiven> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The state where a previously given consent has been 'renewed' or 'refreshed' or 'reaffirmed' to form a new instance of given consent"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#RenewedConsentGiven> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#consent-status-classes> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
