<https://w3id.org/dpv#RenewedConsentGiven> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "An example of this state is when a previously given consent has expired, and the individual is presented a notice regarding continuing associated processing operations - to which they agree. This state can be useful to keep track of 'reconfirmed' or 'refreshed' consent within consent records, assist notices and contextual agents to create better consenting dialogues, and assist with specific legal obligations related to subsequent consenting"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
