<https://w3id.org/dpv#ReversingProcessOutput> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Reversing of outputs indicate discarding the output and going back to the previous output. This is different from correction of output which allows modification of the output - implying continuation of the process."@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
