<https://w3id.org/dpv#Right> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Right"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#Right> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A 'right' is a legal, social, or ethical principle of freedom or entitlement which dictate the norms regarding what is allowed or owed. Rights as a concept encompass a broad area of norms and entities, and are not specific to Individuals or Data Protection / Privacy. For individual specific rights, see dpv:DataSubjectRight"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
