<https://w3id.org/dpv#RightExerciseActivity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "There may be multiple activities associated with exercising and fulfilling rights. See the RightExerciseRecord concept for record-keeping of such activities in a cohesive manner."@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
