<https://w3id.org/dpv#RightExerciseNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Information associated with exercising of an active right such as where and how to exercise the right, information required for it, or updates on an exercised rights request"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#RightExerciseNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#rights-classes> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#RightExerciseNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Right Exercise Notice"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
<https://w3id.org/dpv#RightExerciseNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This concept is intended for providing information regarding a right exercise. For specific instances of such exercises, see RightExerciseActivity and RightExerciseRecord."@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
