<https://w3id.org/dpv#RightExerciseRecord> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This concept represents a record of one or more right exercise activities, such as those associated with a single data subject or service or entity"@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
