<https://w3id.org/dpv#RightNonFulfilmentNotice> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This notice is associated with situations where information is provided with the intention of communicating non-fulfilment of a right. For example, to provide justifications on why a right could not be fulfilled or providing information about another entity  who should be approached for exercising this right."@en <https://w3id.org/dpv#> .
